{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o132a","title":"曹操用贾诩计离间韩遂马超","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o132a-account","label":"正文","text":"渡渭后曹操佯许议和，与韩遂谈旧事，又致多涂改的书信，使马超等怀疑韩遂。","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"离间","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0182","role":"献策","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0048","role":"会谈","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"生疑","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"渭南","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q"]},"time":{"label":"建安十六年九月","year":211,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o132a-q","wudi-q-o128","wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b"],"chronology":"wudi-y211","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o128","basis":"建安十六年九月","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,742,"O132a"],"order":314}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0048","name":"韩遂","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0182","name":"贾诩","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0282","name":"马超","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o132a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-e0f9191c7bec5bbb7c81","layer":"original","quote":"九月，进军渡渭。﹝三﹞超等数挑战，又不许；固请割地，求送任子〖10〗。公用贾诩计〖11〗，伪许之。韩遂请与公相见；公与遂父同岁孝廉，又与遂同时侪辈，于是交马语移时。不及军事；但说京都旧故，拊手欢笑〖12〗。既罢，超等问遂：“公何言？”遂曰：“无所言也。”超等疑之。﹝四﹞他日，公又与遂书，多所点窜〖13〗，如遂改定者，超等愈疑遂。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":66,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":165},{"id":"wudi-q-b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-2dc1a34b174874acae8b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十六年：建安十六年（公元 211）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":54,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-889c5acff5776ef2f54b","start":0,"end":21},{"id":"wudi-q-o128","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-37e542ccc37d1632e170","layer":"original","quote":"十六年春正月〖1〗，﹝一﹞天子命公世子丕为五官中郎将〖2〗，置官属〖3〗；为丞相副。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":51,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
